# Training configuration (--config): Tutorial Unit 2's starting descriptor,
# with three coefficients outside the training data's reach held fixed.
CONFIG     ../../tutorial/unit2/config.train
# Coefficients 1-17 belong to the pair term, 18-28 to embedding blips centred
# at rho = 0, 1, ..., 10 (blip k at rho k). Blips 8-10 (coefficients 26-28)
# start at rho 6-8, above every training density.
# Without these constraints their zero-centred prior gives zero
# coefficients, and F falls back to zero inside the grid, which extends
# to rho 12.
# The fitted coefficients rise from -2.50 at rho 2 to 6.55 at rho 7:
# a mean increment of 1.81. Continuing from rho 7 gives about 8.4, 10.2
# and 12.0, the values of this start, which keeps rising until
# the finite grid bends it over. These values specify extrapolation,
# not a monotonicity constraint: the search can introduce a local dip in F.
# No training density reaches these blips, so the other fitted coefficients
# and predictions inside the training range stay unchanged to round-off.
# Of blips 8-10, only blip 8 reaches the 400 GPa densities with the part
# above a quarter of its peak (rho 7-9); config.hpo searches coefficient 26.
# The data reach only blip 9's flank; blip 10 remains out of reach.
FIXINDEX   26 27 28
FIXWEIGHT  8.4 10.2 12.0
